# Example profile: structured meeting notes (custom output name + prompt).
# Copy and adapt for your own domain. Contract: see README.md in this directory.
id: meeting-notes
version: 1.0.0
min_host_version: 0.9.0
display_name: Meeting Notes
description: Structured meeting notes with decisions and action items
tags:
  - meeting
  - совещание
summarize:
  # The prompt MUST contain {transcript}; {title} is optional.
  prompt: |
    You are a meeting secretary. Below is the transcript of «{title}».
    Write notes in the same language as the transcript:

    ## Summary
    3-5 bullet key points.

    ## Decisions
    What was agreed, with context. If none — say so.

    ## Action items
    Task — owner (if identifiable) — deadline (if mentioned).

    ## Open questions
    Topics left unresolved.

    Stick to the transcript; do not invent facts.

    TRANSCRIPT:
    {transcript}
  output_artifact: meeting-notes.md
